  "title": "Periodical Collection | Library",
  "text": "Periodical Collection | Library UOC OPAC INST. REPOSITORY PAST PAPERS SIMILARITY CHECKING LibQAC SDG GALLERY FAQ CONTACT Menu HOME ABOUT Vision & Mission History History Centenary Former Librarians Opening Hours Membership Registration General Guidelines Library Floor Plan Collections Lending Collection Reference Collection Sri Lanka Collection Law Collection Research Collection Periodical Collection Special Collections Scholars’ Corner CD ROM Collection Policies Research Policy Plagiarism Policy Guideline on Recommended Journals Disclaimer Privacy Policy Email Policy BRANCHES Medical Library Science Library Technology Library Nursing Library Indigenous Medicine Library FGS Library PERSONNEL E-RESOURCES Databases Electronic & Print Journals E-Books Trial Access Open Access Resources SERVICES User Services No Dues & Fines No Dues Certificate Online Fine Payment Guide Other Services ISBN/ISSN/ISMN Services Training Guides Digital Wall PUBLICATIONS University Publications University of Colombo Review UoC Newsletter Library Publications Statistical Newsletter Handbook of the Main Library SYMPOSIUM iLRS 2026 iLRS 2025 LRS 2024 LRS 2023 LRS 2022 LRS 2021 LRS-2020 LRS 2019 LRS 2018 Periodical Collection Home \\ The periodical section is located on the 4th floor . The Central Library maintains periodical collections of Arts, Education, Finance and Management and Social Sciences. Medical and Science periodical collections are available at the relevant branch libraries. The databases such as HEIN online, Oxford law reference and JSTOR (Archive) are available for access. The university consortium consisting Emerald (nearly 220 titles), Taylor and Francis (nearly 1600 titles) and Oxford publishers (200 journals) are available for access. Nearly 762 bound titles are available for reference. These bound journals are not available for a loan yet available for only photocopying. Based on the recommendation and the annual allocation for books and journals, print and online journals are annually subscribed by the University of Colombo. The periodicals section of the central library kept open from 8.00 a.m to 4.00 p.m during weekdays. Last Updated on July 21, 2023 by Main Library Search for: Institutional Repository Find a Book (OPAC) E-Document Supply Service Inter Library Loan (ILL) Past Papers New Arrivals Library News Participation in International Living Lab on Relational Ethics November 4, 2026 Library Book Hunt 2026: Final Round Successfully Held at the Main Library November 2, 2026 University of Colombo Library Academics Receive Senate Awards for Research Excellence October 31, 2026 Colombo Discourse 05 October 15, 2026 Library Cinematic Space: A New Hub for Learning, Creativity and Cultural Engagement October 1, 2026 TOP © 2026 The Main Library, University of Colombo. All rights reserved. HOME ABOUT Vision & Mission History History Centenary Former Librarians Opening Hours Membership Registration General Guidelines Library Floor Plan Collections Lending Collection Reference Collection Sri Lanka Collection Law Collection Research Collection Periodical Collection Special Collections Scholars’ Corner CD ROM Collection Policies Research Policy Plagiarism Policy Guideline on Recommended Journals Disclaimer Privacy Policy Email Policy BRANCHES Medical Library Science Library Technology Library Nursing Library Indigenous Medicine Library FGS Library PERSONNEL E-RESOURCES Databases Electronic & Print Journals E-Books Trial Access Open Access Resources SERVICES User Services No Dues & Fines No Dues Certificate Online Fine Payment Guide Other Services ISBN/ISSN/ISMN Services Training Guides Digital Wall PUBLICATIONS University Publications University of Colombo Review UoC Newsletter Library Publications Statistical Newsletter Handbook of the Main Library SYMPOSIUM iLRS 2026 iLRS 2025 LRS 2024 LRS 2023 LRS 2022 LRS 2021 LRS-2020 LRS 2019 LRS 2018 UOC OPAC INST. REPOSITORY PAST PAPERS SIMILARITY CHECKING LibQAC SDG GALLERY FAQ CONTACT",
